{"seq":8,"slug":"geography","title":"高三地理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"高三地理-简介\">高三地理 简介</h1><p>高三地理以高考为导向，将自然地理和人文地理的知识进行系统整合，强化区域分析和综合应用的能力。高考地理的突出特点是&quot;无图不成题&quot;和&quot;情境化命题&quot;，要求学生在陌生的区域情境中灵活运用地理原理分析问题、提出对策。这一年的复习重在将碎片化的地理知识整合为可迁移的分析框架。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向高三年级文科学生，适合已完成高中地理全部课程、进入系统备考阶段的学习者。全书共分三章，覆盖高考地理复习的核心方向。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>自然地理综合复习</strong>系统回顾地球运动、大气运动、水循环、地貌成因和自然资源等自然地理核心内容，强化自然地理过程的因果分析能力，重点突破地球运动的时间计算、气候类型判断和地貌成因分析等高考高频难点。第二章<strong>人文地理综合复习</strong>整合人口、城市、农业、工业和交通等人文地理内容，强化区位分析的方法论和区域比较的能力，重点突破区位选择评价、区域发展方案分析等综合应用类试题。第三章<strong>地理备考实战</strong>讲解高考地理的命题趋势和答题策略，分析选择题组的信息提取方法、综合题的答题模板和区域认知题的分析框架，帮助学生建立&quot;读图-提取-分析-表达&quot;的完整解题流程。</p>\n<p>推荐自然地理和人文地理交替复习，每轮复习后进行区域综合题目的实战训练。地理备考务必保持大量读图画图的习惯，培养空间思维能力。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"natural-review","title":"自然地理综合复习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/natural-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atmosphere-review","title":"高三地理 — 大气圈综合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/natural-review/atmosphere-review"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hydrosphere-review","title":"高三地理 — 水圈综合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/natural-review/hydrosphere-review"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lithosphere-review","title":"高三地理 — 岩石圈综合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/natural-review/lithosphere-review"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"human-review","title":"人文地理综合复习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/human-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"population-urbanization","title":"高三地理 — 人口与城市化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/human-review/population-urbanization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"industry-agriculture","title":"高三地理 — 工农业布局","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/human-review/industry-agriculture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"transportation-trade","title":"高三地理 — 交通与贸易","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/human-review/transportation-trade"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"geography-exam","title":"地理备考实战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/geography-exam","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"map-reading","title":"高三地理 — 读图分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/geography-exam/map-reading"},{"seq":2,"slug":"comprehensive-problems","title":"高三地理 — 综合题突破","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/geography-exam/comprehensive-problems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"geography-mock-analysis","title":"高三地理 — 模拟试题解析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/geography/geography-exam/geography-mock-analysis"}]}]}